          "target": "apps/one-terminal/src-tauri/src/layout/dashboard.rs",
          "description": "Plan 15 \u2014 dashboards move from N per-Terminal lists to one process-wide shared registry (DashboardRegistry + DashboardSession split, stable dashboard ids, cross-window live sync, an in-memory active-dashboard exclusivity lock, and Duplicate/Move-here actions for a dashboard locked elsewhere). Replaces 7 backend files wholesale \u2014 they must all land together, since a partial apply will not compile. The on-disk data migration itself (merging each existing terminals/<id>/dashboards.json into one shared dashboards.json, disambiguating any name collisions) is NOT a scaffolder step: it runs automatically, once, the first time the upgraded app launches (TerminalManager::load_dashboards_registry / persist::load_or_migrate_registry) \u2014 nothing manual required here.",
